  "summary_en": "Technical paper proposing ROS-Defender, combining SDN-based policy enforcement (ROSDN), anomaly detection (ROSWatch) and a ROS-Policy-Language to secure Robot Operating System applications against attacks such as forged messages, denial of service and compromised nodes, going beyond SROS.",
